{"domain": "www.thwacksportingco.com", "products": [{"id": 8829341302899, "title": "Dew Sweeper", "handle": "dew-sweeper-brush", "body_html": "<h2></h2>\n<p><span>Built for the golfer who\u2019d rather clean a club with something that belongs on the bag.</span></p>\n<p>The Dew Sweeper starts with an American-made hardwood brush fitted with\u00a0.012\" nylon bristles, arranged in 2 \u00d7 5 rows with a \u00bd\" trim and a 30\u00b0 angled head. The compact profile gets into grooves easily while the angled bristles make quick work of dirt, grass, and whatever else the course leaves behind.</p>\n<p>A fixed cord tether is finished with a mini swivel trigger snap, made from solid low-lead brass with a natural brass finish and compact 3/8\" eye. The swivel clasp gives the brush a secure attachment point while keeping it easy to clip onto a golf bag. <meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>I can substitute in a magnetic release instead of the brass snap if that is your personal preference.</strong></p>\n<p><span>Simple materials. Useful hardware. No oversized plastic housing or unnecessary gadgetry.</span></p>\n<p><strong>I have three color options currently. If you have a specific request then message and I will try to accommodate.\u00a0 \u00a0</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>Details</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span>American-made hardwood brusg</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>.012\" nylon bristles</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>2 \u00d7 5 bristle rows</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>\u00bd\" bristle trim</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>30\u00b0 angled brush head</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>Fixed cord tether</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>Solid brass mini swivel trigger snap (Magnetic release also available)\u00a0</span><span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>3/8\" clasp eye</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>Made to get dirty. Built to look better doing it.</span></p>", "published_at": "2026-09-21T18:36:38-04:00", "created_at": "2026-09-20T13:56:54-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00", "vendor": "Thwack Sporting Co.", "product_type": "Golf Accessories", "tags": ["dew-sweeper"], "variants": [{"id": 48384770539635, "title": "Twilight", "option1": "Twilight", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 41372260663411, "product_id": 8829341302899, "position": 2, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:04-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:06-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 4032, "height": 3024, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/Dew-Sweeper-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955166", "variant_ids": [48384770539635]}, "available": true, "price": "29.00", "grams": 340, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8829341302899, "created_at": "2026-09-20T22:15:51-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00"}, {"id": 48384770506867, "title": "New River", "option1": "New River", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 41372260696179, "product_id": 8829341302899, "position": 6, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:04-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:06-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 4032, "height": 3024, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6962-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955166", "variant_ids": [48384770506867]}, "available": true, "price": "29.00", "grams": 340, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 2, "product_id": 8829341302899, "created_at": "2026-09-20T22:15:51-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00"}, {"id": 48384770572403, "title": "Spruce Knob", "option1": "Spruce Knob", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 41372260630643, "product_id": 8829341302899, "position": 7, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:03-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:05-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 4032, "height": 3024, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6960-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955165", "variant_ids": [48384770572403]}, "available": true, "price": "29.00", "grams": 340, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 3, "product_id": 8829341302899, "created_at": "2026-09-20T22:15:51-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41372256272499, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:00-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:02-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6966-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955162", "width": 4032, "height": 3024}, {"id": 41372260663411, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:04-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:06-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [48384770539635], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/Dew-Sweeper-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955166", "width": 4032, "height": 3024}, {"id": 41372400844915, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:48:39-04:00", "position": 3, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:48:41-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_5290.jpg?v=1789955321", "width": 3024, "height": 4032}, {"id": 41372400910451, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:48:39-04:00", "position": 4, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:48:41-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_5299.jpg?v=1789955321", "width": 3024, "height": 4032}, {"id": 41372400812147, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:48:39-04:00", "position": 5, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:48:40-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_5295.jpg?v=1789955320", "width": 3024, "height": 4032}, {"id": 41372260696179, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:04-04:00", "position": 6, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:06-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [48384770506867], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6962-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955166", "width": 4032, "height": 3024}, {"id": 41372260630643, "created_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:03-04:00", "position": 7, "updated_at": "2026-09-20T21:46:05-04:00", "product_id": 8829341302899, "variant_ids": [48384770572403], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6960-Enhanced.jpg?v=1789955165", "width": 4032, "height": 3024}], "options": [{"name": "Colorway", "position": 1, "values": ["Twilight", "New River", "Spruce Knob"]}]}, {"id": 8395979227251, "title": "Pick Your Own Hickory Switch", "handle": "pick-your-own-switch", "body_html": "<h1>Pick Your Own Hickory Switch</h1>\n<p>If you grew up anywhere near Appalachia, there's a decent chance you heard the words:</p>\n<p><em>\"Go pick your own switch.\"</em></p>\n<p>Every kid knew what that meant. The trick was finding one that was <em>just right</em>\u2014too small and you'd have to go back, too big and...well...that was your own fault.</p>\n<p>This time, though, the switch is entirely on your terms.</p>\n<p>Using the configurator above, build a hickory alignment stick that's uniquely yours. Choose your thread colors, wrap style, and finishing details to create a practice companion that's as personal as your golf swing.</p>\n<p>Each stick starts with hand-selected American hickory, prized for generations for its strength, resilience, and character. We wrap every stick by hand using premium Irish Crawford thread before finishing it with the same care that goes into traditional sporting goods built to last.</p>\n<p>No two golfers practice exactly alike, and no two custom switches should either.</p>\n<p>Whether you prefer timeless earth tones, bold tournament colors, or something that matches your bag perfectly, this is your chance to build a stick that's unmistakably yours.</p>\n<p>Because some traditions are worth keeping.</p>\n<p>Just maybe not for the same reasons anymore.</p>\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hand-selected American hickory</li>\n<li>Hand-wrapped with premium Irish Crawford thread</li>\n<li>Both sticks feature your primary-and-accent wrap pattern\u2014an upgrade from the solid companion stick included with the Pioneer Series</li>\n<li>Built to order</li>\n<li>Made in small batches</li>\n<li>Designed by you. Built by hand.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom quotes are available for more elaborate wraps or designs using more than two colors.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Please note: Thread colors may vary slightly between dye lots.</em></p>", "published_at": "2026-09-11T00:06:58-04:00", "created_at": "2026-09-10T23:11:54-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00", "vendor": "Thwack Sporting Co.", "product_type": "", "tags": ["Sample Product"], "variants": [{"id": 45473777090675, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "139.00", "grams": 862, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8395979227251, "created_at": "2026-09-10T23:11:54-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41250226438259, "created_at": "2026-09-11T07:28:30-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-09-11T07:28:32-04:00", "product_id": 8395979227251, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/pick-your-own-switch-custom-wrap-cropped.png?v=1789126112", "width": 1086, "height": 1448}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8338423021683, "title": "Pioneer Series Alignment Sticks - Pair", "handle": "pioneer-series-alignment-stick-set", "body_html": "<p>Two handcrafted American hickory alignment sticks in complementary wrap designs\u2014one accented and one solid.</p>\n<p>Accent Wrap=1.5/\"6\"/1.5\"\u00a0</p>\n<p>Solid Wrap= 9\"</p>\n<p><strong>Includes two handcrafted 42-inch alignment sticks.</strong></p>", "published_at": "2026-07-17T11:17:00-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-17T11:16:59-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00", "vendor": "Thwack Sporting Co.", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45258722377843, "title": "New River", "option1": "New River", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 40886165340275, "product_id": 8338423021683, "position": 2, "created_at": "2026-07-24T20:44:10-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-24T22:53:40-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 4032, "height": 3024, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6559.png?v=1784948020", "variant_ids": [45258722377843]}, "available": true, "price": "109.00", "grams": 907, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8338423021683, "created_at": "2026-07-17T13:17:21-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00"}, {"id": 45258722410611, "title": "Spruce Knob", "option1": "Spruce Knob", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 40886165307507, "product_id": 8338423021683, "position": 3, "created_at": "2026-07-24T20:44:10-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-24T23:00:00-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 3341, "height": 1880, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0716/0335/5763/files/IMG_6564.png?v=1784948400", "variant_ids": [45258722410611]}, "available": true, "price": "109.00", "grams": 862, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 2, "product_id": 8338423021683, "created_at": "2026-07-17T13:17:21-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:04:37-04:00"}, {"id": 45258722443379, "title": "Cranberry Glades", "option1": "Cranberry Glades", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 40886165241971, "product_id": 8338423021683, "position": 4, "created_at": "2026-07-24T20:44:10-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-24T20:44:1